OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be mostly cloudy with
OL,6,Fpatchy light rain through the morning,
OL,7,Fthe rain then turning heavier and more
OL,8,Fpersistent at times during the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Winds mainly light and
OL,10,Frather variable in direction.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThe rain clearing east during
OL,13,Fthis evening with clear spells and a
OL,14,Fscattering of showers overnight. Winds
OL,15,Fturning into the west or northwest and
OL,16,Flight or moderate.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSunday:FMainly dry and bright although
OL,19,Fthere will be a scattering of showers.
OL,20,FFeeling chilly in the moderate to
OL,21,Ffresh northwest winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
